// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/nested_labels_pos_01.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A label chain nests LabeledStatement nodes, so an outer label's child is the
// inner label rather than the loop. The label projection used to reject that
// shape, failing the whole owner body and reaching the driver as an internal
// compiler error. It now drains as a capability diagnostic.

// CHECK: Error [ZOM4096]: this control-flow construct is not supported yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/05-statements/nested_labels_pos_01.zom:2:19

// CHECK-NOT: internal compiler error
